---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const CONTACT = "contact@peoplesrepublicofbulgaria.com";
---

<Base
  title="Legal notice & privacy | People's Republic of Bulgaria"
  description="Who runs peoplesrepublicofbulgaria.com, what data is collected and how to have it deleted."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <main class="legal">
    <a class="legal__back" href="/">Back to PRB</a>
    <h1>Legal notice &amp; privacy</h1>

    <dl>
      <dt>Who runs this site</dt>
      <dd>Simon Beltran, a private individual, Sofia, Bulgaria. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`}>{CONTACT}</a></dd>

      <dt>Hosting</dt>
      <dd>Vercel.</dd>

      <dt>What I collect</dt>
      <dd>Your email address, only if you sign up for the newsletter.</dd>

      <dt>Why</dt>
      <dd>To send you the newsletter. Nothing else.</dd>

      <dt>Legal basis</dt>
      <dd>Your consent, given when you tick the box.</dd>

      <dt>Who handles it</dt>
      <dd>Resend, the service that sends the newsletter emails.</dd>

      <dt>Outside the EU</dt>
      <dd>Resend and Vercel are US companies, so your data may be processed outside the European Union.</dd>

      <dt>Your IP address</dt>
      <dd>Used briefly to stop abuse of the form, and kept for a short time in the host's logs.</dd>

      <dt>How long</dt>
      <dd>Until you unsubscribe.</dd>

      <dt>Unsubscribe, access or deletion</dt>
      <dd>Just send an email to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`}>{CONTACT}</a>.</dd>

      <dt>Changed your mind?</dt>
      <dd>You can withdraw your consent at any time, with an email to the same address.</dd>

      <dt>Complaints</dt>
      <dd>You can complain to the Bulgarian data protection authority, <a href="https://cpdp.bg/">КЗЛД / CPDP</a>.</dd>

      <dt>Cookies and tracking</dt>
      <dd>No tracking tools on this site. The YouTube video only loads after you click it, and YouTube may then set its own cookies.</dd>
    </dl>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1rem var(--gutter) 2rem;
  }
  dd {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .legal {
      padding-top: 2rem;
    }
    .legal h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 5rem) !important;
      line-height: 0.95 !important;
      margin-bottom: 2.25rem !important;
    }
    .legal dl {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 22rem) minmax(0, 46rem);
      column-gap: 3rem;
      row-gap: 0.25rem;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(201, 154, 76, 0.45);
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
    }
    .legal dt {
      padding-top: 0.2rem;
    }
  }
  .legal__back {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--cream);
  }
  dl {
    margin: 0;
  }
  dt {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  dd {
    margin: 0.125rem 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
</style>
